<title>AUSTRIA: Austria 1996 c/a deficit eases to 42.4 bln ATS.</title>
<headline>Austria 1996 c/a deficit eases to 42.4 bln ATS.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank reported the following economic indicator details on Thursday.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN CURRENT ACCOUNT	  1996	 1995</p>
<p> Current account balance ATS  -42.4 bln   -47.0 bln</p>
<p> Merchandise trade balance    -76.6 bln   -72.9 bln</p>
<p> Exports			    771.5 bln   732.8 bln</p>
<p> Imports			    848.0 bln   805.7 bln</p>
<p>NOTES - The figures for 1996 are preliminary. The 1996 current account deficit amounts to 1.8 percent of gross domestic product, down from two percent in 1995, the central bank said.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
